nent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreSilence_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreSilence (spell flag)\">IgnoreSilence</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreVisionBlock_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreVisionBlock (spell flag)\">IgnoreVisionBlock</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Detecting_Presence\"> Condition: Detecting Presence </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Detecting_Presence_(Condition)\" title=\"Detecting Presence (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detecting Presence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Detecting_Presence_(Condition)\" title=\"Detecting Presence (Condition)\">Detecting Presence</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Searching for <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Invisible\">Invisible</a> creatures within 3 m (10 ft) that must make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>) or be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Revealed_(Condition)\" title=\"Revealed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Revealed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/See_Invisibility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Revealed_(Condition)\" title=\"Revealed (Condition)\">Revealed</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i> \n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Though functionally similar to a <a href=\"/wiki/Class_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class action\">class action</a>, this ability's tooltip does not classify it as such.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035651\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2259/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34055/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12263/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1057069/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n105.95%   59.125     28 Template:Trim\n100.00%   55.803      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   55.803      1 -total\n 22.11%   12.339      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 17.87%    9.973      1 Template:Condition\n 13.71%    7.651      1 Template:Resource\n 12.62%    7.045      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.69%    5.964      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.50%    5.859      3 Template:Icon_text\n  7.18%    4.006      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with